{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954040/extras/ffb77c879f053f9f90dfa03b9280b7b0.poster.avif?t=1771080424\" width=1170 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954040/extras/ffb77c879f053f9f90dfa03b9280b7b0.webm?t=1771080424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A heartwarming <strong>buddy comedy adventure</strong> set in a colorful  utopian space mall. <strong>Explore</strong> casinos, hotels, bars, gardens, a nonsensical trade show, and touch some synthetic grass. A <strong>fully voiced</strong> ensemble of <strong>quirky characters</strong>. <strong>Cinematic cut-scenes</strong> and an <strong>original synth-heavy score</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954040/extras/79945c8c23c71e15353e7c21cbab593f.poster.avif?t=1771080424\" width=1170 height=800 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954040/extras/79945c8c23c71e15353e7c21cbab593f.webm?t=1771080424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are <i>Cargo</i>. An alien with a heart of gold and dreams made of stars. When a freak transporter accident fuses his mind with his idol\u00a0\u2014 the legendary, presumed-dead scientist <i>Nova Cassidy</i>, Cargo's plans to start a new life are put on hold.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nova concludes the sinister <strong><i>TEAL Corporation</i></strong> sabotaged her, which now controls <strong><i>The Plaza</i></strong>, turning it from the place of scientific progress Nova once envisioned, into a space mall with bars, shops, hotels, casinos and many more questionable attractions.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Cargo loves this place</strong> <strong>\u2014 Nova hates it!\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Can they work through their differences to bring Nova back to reality?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954040/extras/b0fd8bfc71f0e6ca3a483de43db17da6.poster.avif?t=1771080424\" width=1170 height=1200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954040/extras/b0fd8bfc71f0e6ca3a483de43db17da6.webm?t=1771080424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2954040?t=1771080424","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954040/2d2627c20fe185307a05f1ab5fcd730a0bac37dc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771080424","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954040/502b7d7ca9b1c58284ec7462463f092aca660cf6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771080424","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954040/502b7d7ca9b1c58284ec7462463f092aca660cf6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771080424","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay